cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, models, or data in your research, please cite our IEEE BIBM 2026 paper."
title: "Knowledge Graph-Informed Foundation Model for Microbiome-Cardiovascular Disease Classification"
abstract: "We introduce a biologically grounded foundation model for human gut microbiome data that integrates a multi-relational biomedical knowledge graph into transformer pretraining via Relational Graph Convolutional Networks (R-GCN). Across cross-cohort transfer evaluations spanning Type 2 Diabetes and Cardiovascular Disease, knowledge graph pretraining improves cross-study transfer over random initialization in 7 of 8 cohort transfers."
